WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:13.700
Listings: listings (property, cars, boats…) with attributes, price, photos and a public page; the assistant suggests matching listings from what the customer wants.

2
00:00:14.248 --> 00:00:21.400
If you have no listing types yet, click "Create ready-made types" to create your trade's types with ready attributes.

3
00:00:21.949 --> 00:00:29.330
Click "New listing"; write the three-language title, price, attributes and each language's description.

4
00:00:29.884 --> 00:00:33.200
Upload photos or pick them "From the library…".

5
00:00:33.745 --> 00:00:39.930
For many listings use "Import from CSV"; put the "Listing page link" in stories.

6
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:47.550
Don't delete a sold listing; change its status so the assistant stops offering it and the history stays.
